    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d728">

                <pb facs="0805" n="793" sameAs="frus:frus1940v03/pg793"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">881.00/1719a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Matthews</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-11-30T14:00:00-05:00">November 30,
                            1940—2 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>777. Your 1044, November 27, 5 p.m.,<anchor n="25" xml:id="d728-f1"/> sections 2
                    and 3. Please comment on a report which has been received by the Department that
                    the French Government has relinquished its rights in the Tangier zone and has
                    accepted Spanish control over that zone.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
